          "notes": [{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-1-n1","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-1","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","he":"הכוס כאן היא כוס של ברכת המזון לפי הברטנורא. אין זו יחידת הנפח המכונה כיום כוס במתכונים.","en":"Bartenura identifies this as the cup for the blessing after the meal, not the modern recipe measure called a cup.","sourceTextSHA256":"17bb40cffe02f37952181ff363e2f93467b36f2187a449910294c0f5a573383a","span":{"start":18,"end":41,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"}},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-1-n2","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-1","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","he":"שיעורי ההוצאה, המחלוקות והכרעות הברטנורא בפרק הם חומר לימוד, לא הוראות הלכתיות למעשה. תיאורי הרפואה הקדומים אינם המלצות רפואיות.","en":"The chapter's carrying thresholds, disputes and Bartenura's legal conclusions are material for study, not practical legal instructions. Its ancient medicinal uses are not medical recommendations.","sourceTextSHA256":"17bb40cffe02f37952181ff363e2f93467b36f2187a449910294c0f5a573383a","span":{"start":67,"end":308,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"}},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-1-meaning-qualification-3","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-1","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"17bb40cffe02f37952181ff363e2f93467b36f2187a449910294c0f5a573383a","span":{"start":0,"end":374,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"הכוס אינה יחידת נפח מודרנית. ברטנורא מזהה כוס ברכת המזון ומפרט יין חי ומים; אין כאן המרת השיעור ליחידות מודרניות.","en":"The cup is not a modern volume unit. Bartenura identifies the cup for the blessing after the meal and specifies unmixed wine and water; no modern conversion is supplied."},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-1-meaning-qualification-4","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-1","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"17bb40cffe02f37952181ff363e2f93467b36f2187a449910294c0f5a573383a","span":{"start":0,"end":374,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"׳למצניעיהן׳ מסייג את דעת רבי שמעון, לא מחייב כל אדם בכל שהוא. ברטנורא מוסר מינימום גם למצניע עצמו.","en":"The storage qualification limits רבי שמעון’s position, not liability for everyone for any quantity. Bartenura preserves a minimum even for the person storing it."},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-1-meaning-qualification-5","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-1","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"17bb40cffe02f37952181ff363e2f93467b36f2187a449910294c0f5a573383a","span":{"start":0,"end":374,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"השיעורים, המחלוקות והתנאים הם ביאור הנוסח ופירושו, לא פסיקה למעשה או המלצה רפואית.","en":"The measures, disputes and conditions explain the received text and commentary, not practical legal or medical advice."}]
