          "notes": [{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-5-n1","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-5","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","he":"כף הסיד היא כלי של סיידים לפי הברטנורא, ולא כף אכילה תקנית.","en":"Bartenura identifies the lime measure with a plasterer's implement, not a standard eating spoon.","sourceTextSHA256":"328e55307b4041c7fc45d838794c9bb3d88ba2f58516e526317f877452210517","span":{"start":267,"end":281,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"}},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-5-meaning-qualification-2","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-5","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"328e55307b4041c7fc45d838794c9bb3d88ba2f58516e526317f877452210517","span":{"start":0,"end":429,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"חותמי מרצופים ואגרות שונים בשימוש ובשיעור, וכן כרוב וכרשא; שני ייחוסי המחלוקת נשמרים. אין המרת חותם, כף או ביצה למידות מודרניות.","en":"Sack-seals and letter-seals differ in use and measure, as do cabbage stalk and leek; both disputes retain their attributions. Seal, spoon and egg are not converted into modern measures."},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-5-meaning-qualification-3","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-5","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"328e55307b4041c7fc45d838794c9bb3d88ba2f58516e526317f877452210517","span":{"start":0,"end":429,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"עב ומרוסס הם חלופות בקנה. הביצה קלה לבישול, לא בהכרח במשקל. שמן, כגרוגרת ואלפס שחומם כבר הם פרטי ברטנורא, לא תוספות למשנה.","en":"Thick and crushed are alternative reed conditions. The egg is easy to cook, not necessarily light in weight. Oil, a dried-fig-sized portion and an already heated pan are Bartenura’s details, not added Mishna clauses."},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-5-meaning-qualification-4","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-5","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"328e55307b4041c7fc45d838794c9bb3