          "notes": [{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-7-n1","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-7","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","he":"פצים מתבאר בברטנורא בתוך תיאור של פצימין, עמודין וקורות וסמיכה מלמטה. אין כאן זיהוי ודאי של רכיב בנייה מודרני מסוים.","en":"Bartenura explains the structural member through frames, posts, beams and support from below. A particular modern building component is not securely identified here.","sourceTextSHA256":"f024a2228840ed9d06719d72c73ca20319a71e67d5d4242b730c5e29d5af8b1a","span":{"start":21,"end":45,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"}},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-7-source-qualification-2","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-7","role":"source-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"f024a2228840ed9d06719d72c73ca20319a71e67d5d4242b730c5e29d5af8b1a","span":{"start":0,"end":403,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"פצים מתורגם בכלליות כחלק מבני. ברטנורא מזכיר פצימין, עמודים וקורות וסמיכה מלמטה; אין זיהוי אדריכלי מודרני מדויק.","en":"The structural-member rendering is general: Bartenura mentions frames, posts and beams supported from below, not a precise modern architectural identification."},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-7-meaning-qualification-3","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-7","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"f024a2228840ed9d06719d72c73ca20319a71e67d5d4242b730c5e29d5af8b1a","span":{"start":0,"end":403,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"׳אין ראיה׳, ׳זכר לדבר׳ ו׳משם ראיה׳ הם טיעונים נבדלים. שני קטעי הפסוק וההפניות ישעיה ל ושם נשמרים; אין קביעה עצמאית שהפסוק לבדו קובע את שיעור החרס.","en":"‘No proof,’ ‘a reminder’ and ‘from there comes proof’ are differing claims. Both verse fragments and chapter and ‘ibid.’ references remain; no independent claim that Scripture alone determines the sherd’s measure is added."},{"id":"mishna-shabbat-8-7-meaning-qualification-4","owner":"mishna-shabbat-8-7","role":"meaning-qualification","placement":"outside-source-disclosure","sourceTextSHA256":"f024a2228840ed9d06719d72c73ca20319a71e67d5d4242b730c5e29d5af8b1a","span":{"start":0,"end":403,"endExclusive":true,"unit":"unicode-codepoint"},"he":"השיעורים, המחלוקות והתנאים הם ביאור הנוסח ופירושו, לא פסיקה למעשה או המלצה רפואית.","en":"The measures, disputes and conditions explain the received text and commentary, not practical legal or medical advice."}]
